  "text_pages": [
    "Academic Calendar for DEEP | Tohoku University\nAcademic Calendar for DEEP\nTOP\n>\nFor International Students\n>\nExchange Programs\n>\nDEEP\n>\nAcademic Calendar for DEEP\n(Updated February 19, 2026)\nAcademic Calendar (Faculty/School)\nGeneral Education\nFaculty of Science\nSchool of Medicene\nSchool of Dentistry\nFaculty of Pharmaceutical\nSchool of Engineering\nFaculty of Agriculture\nFall Semester (Oct. 2025 - Mar. 2026)\n★Mandatory\n★\nProgram Orientation\nSep. 30, 2025\nClass begins\nOct. 1, 2025\nCourse Registration Period\nOct. 1 - 14, 2025\nWinter Holiday\nDec. 29, 2025 - Jan. 3, 2026\nClass ends\nFeb. 3, 2026\nSelf-Education Period**\nFeb. 4 - Mar.31\n**Only applicable to those attending the fall-and-spring program.\nClass Schedule of AY2025 General Education Subjects\nAcademic Calendar of AY2025 General Education Subjects\nSpring Semester (Apr. 2026- Sep. 2026)\n★Mandatory\n★\nProgram Orientation\nApr. 2, 2026\nClass begins\nApr. 8, 2026\nCourse Registration Period\nApr. 8 - Apr. 21, 2026\nClass ends\nAug. 5, 2026\nSummer Holiday (Only for Spring-Fall students)\nAug. 6, 2026 - Sep. 30, 2026\nClass Schedule of AY2026 General Education Subjects\nAcademic Calendar of AY2026 General Education Subjects\nNOTE:\n- Dates are subject to change."
